# Legacy URL → new URL (301). Loaded by `map $uri $bigcat_redirect { include ...; }`.
# Format:  /old-path   /new-path;
#
# !!! CANDIDATES ONLY — the existing site could not be crawled when this map was drafted.
# Before production cutover: export every URL from the CURRENT site (old sitemap.xml,
# Search Console > Pages, Google Analytics landing pages, and a crawl), then confirm,
# add or remove lines so every legacy URL with traffic or backlinks maps to its closest
# new page. Never redirect everything to the homepage. See docs/REDIRECTS.md.
